X.ff
X\fBWback (\fIw\fB)
XWin *\fIw\fB;\fR
X.fe
XMoves window \fIw\fR to the "back" of the screen (i.e.  window \fIw\fR is
Xcovered by all other windows that it intersects).  This is the inverse
