X.ff
X\fBWcurleft (\fIw\fB,\fR \fIn\fB)
XWin *\fIw\fB;
Xint\fR \fIn\fB;\fR
X.fe
XMoves the window cursor in window \fIw\fR left \fIn\fR characters, possibly
