XWin *\fIw\fB;
Xint\fR \fIn\fB;\fR
X.fe
XDeletes \fIn\fR lines from the text buffer attached to window \fIw\fR at \fIw\fR's
Xwindow cursor row.  Also deletes \fIn\fR lines from \fIw\fR's winbuf, at the
